    {
      "id": "b-841",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Last-write-wins with conflict markers?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-842",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- CRDT-based eventual consistency?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-843",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Manual merge tool?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-844",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Scale Limits**: When does single graph.jsonld become unwieldy?"
        }
      ]
    },
